   "lines": [
    "I rode over early in the",
    "morning to Chestnut",
    "Hill to spend the day.",
    "After lunch I went",
    "out driving with",
    "Rose, Alice and",
    "Endicott. I had",
    "to ride back to",
    "Cambridge immediately",
    "after dinner, to go",
    "to a \"conversazione\" at",
    "Laughlins, where I met",
    "one of the Miss Long-",
    "-fellows - a bright,",
    "clever girl."
   ],
